  },
  "description": "Journald logs from the fleet, shipped by Grafana Alloy and stored in Loki. The error panel filters to error and warning priorities so a spike on the vitals or deploy panels can be traced to the lines that caused it; the host variable scopes both panels to one machine or the whole fleet.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Journald",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 1,
      "description": "Journald lines that read like errors or warnings. Three benign info lines are excluded because they merely contain the searched words: ntfy's hourly 'Server stats' (emails_received_failure=0), Grafana's feature-flag 'flag evaluation succeeded' (ErrorCode/ErrorMessage fields), and the backup job's rclone table header ('Elapsed time').",
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{host=~\"$host\"} |~ \"(?i)error|warn|fail|crit|emerg|alert\" !~ \"emails_received_failure|flag evaluation|Elapsed time\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Errors and warnings",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{host=~\"$host\"}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "All logs",
      "type": "logs"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 40,
